---
title: Context bundle · pinned revisions and the freshness check
---
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant ctl as Controller
  participant asm as Context assembler
  participant role as Model role · Jev, Sol, or voice tool
  participant signal as Product Signal

  ctl->>asm: assemble for a purpose
  asm->>signal: read current revisions + sources
  asm-->>ctl: immutable bundle · pins every revision
  ctl->>role: bundle
  Note over signal: A correction or changed observation<br/>may advance a revision meanwhile.
  role-->>ctl: result + bundle identity + dependencies
  ctl->>signal: lock · compare the revisions the purpose depends on
  alt dependencies current
    ctl->>signal: apply the result
  else stale
    Note over ctl: Keep as diagnostic evidence.<br/>No scope update, no effect.
    opt Implementation Gate classification or proposal
      ctl->>asm: decide again on fresh context · at most three times per step
    end
  end
